# Packages (core / server / react)

Protocol change: `core` routes + Zod schemas + types → `createS3Client` → `dimahS3` `createS3Endpoint` routes + HTTP handler → react hooks. No duplicate route strings.

New endpoint: `api/routes/` + `DimahS3Config` hooks. New react hook: `hooks/` + `upload/` helpers; depend on `@dimah-s3/core` only.

Server plugins: contract in `packages/server/src/plugin/` (`definePlugin`, `applyPlugins`); HTTP via `createS3Endpoint`. Client plugins: `@dimah-s3/core` (`defineClientPlugin`, `createS3Client({ plugins })`, `getActions`, `pluginPath`); React apps use `createS3Client` from `@dimah-s3/react`. Feature plugins (e.g. `db()` / `dbClient()`) in their packages. Merge once in `dimahS3()`; contexts flatten onto the instance (`s3[id]`).

Public API change → Tegami changelog (`.tegami/`). Build: `tsup` + `package.json` `exports`.

